# P2 File Pipeline - Aussie EcoLens

## Overview

This document describes the P2 file handling pipeline for the Aussie EcoLens project.

P2 is responsible for handling files uploaded to Amazon S3. The pipeline supports:

- S3 upload event handling
- SHA256 checksum-based deduplication
- Automatic deletion of duplicate uploads
- Image thumbnail generation
- Video frame extraction
- Metadata storage in DynamoDB
- P3 tagging handoff payload preparation

The current implementation has been tested in an AWS Academy account and is prepared for deployment into the shared integration AWS account.

---

## AWS Services Used

The P2 pipeline uses the following AWS services:

- Amazon S3
- AWS Lambda
- Amazon DynamoDB
- Amazon CloudWatch Logs
- AWS IAM
- Lambda Layers

